    "detailed_description": "This game is an idle game where you go through different levels of civilization to unlock new upgrades and features to help you advance to the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main objective is to reach the final level without a meteor destroying your civilization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMeteors will rain down often, but in return we will offer you resources to improve and grow your civilization even more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollecting wandering souls, sending your hero on an expedition, doing research and improving the powers of your god are some of the functions<br />\r\nthat will allow you to improve your civilization despite the incessant extinctions.",
